{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）愛女陳康堤早前宣布與香港網球新星黃澤林（Coleman）半年情玩完，男方火速撻着「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）惹來全城狂轟，被質疑「無縫接軌」！陳奕迅與太太徐濠縈愛女心切，早已全數取消關注黃澤林的帳號，一家三口連成一線！康堤收拾心情回復工作狀態，Eason再現一舉動力撐女兒！</p><figure><img alt=\"Eason與康堤父女情深。（IG@_constancec_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133063820802002944271563.png/b8M2kjJf92AtZQdYRDdRkQWPZAcxkusdvnQWAr50FgI\"/><figcaption>Eason與康堤父女情深。（IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳奕迅（Eason）攜愛女陳康堤觀眾席。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261003/1183075511929147392648573.jpeg/u7Y2pcGWVVcG5ByycmDhmapIwcUr9Mt58x9eX_MfXl8\"/><figcaption>陳奕迅（Eason）攜愛女陳康堤觀眾席。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>陳奕迅一舉動力撐康堤</p><p>康堤日前在Instagram限時動態分享，與爸爸陳奕迅及同名為Eason的音樂人陳易行同行照片。照片中康堤祝陳易行生日快樂，陳奕迅與陳易行合照，笑得燦爛。之後康堤又與陳易行一齊拍片，相信陳奕迅是陪女兒工作，分手後陪住康堤周圍去，足見對女兒的支持，實在是好爸爸！</p><figure><img alt=\"Eason陪女兒周圍去。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197674688566923264631845.jpeg/ZljcT-eKrYIalkt3I1bOyK00OOvoIZP6U3fnHFN35xw\"/><figcaption>Eason陪女兒周圍去。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"康堤收拾心情工作。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197674686138290176249631.jpeg/QZlIyvcMPcz0wj_s14cR93cRIfg9NmWVpN9lY6TfZWM\"/><figcaption>康堤收拾心情工作。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:17:48.355028+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:12.164269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:12.164269+00:00","content_hash":"1f1ece0b7cba0cf02598b89cc295d19b80e3b6852c63d678937a9740819b5fbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}